  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n8.99 + 17.99 - 3.99 × 2.99 = ?\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nBasic Arithmetic Operations\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n8.99 + 17.99 - 3.99 × 2.99 = ?\n\n⇒ 8.99 + 17.99 - (3.99 × 2.99)\n\n⇒ 8.99 + 17.99 - 11.92\n\n⇒ 26.98 - 11.92\n\n⇒ 15.06\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (3).**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ca81259519cadfb2d5350673c220e419e60378e9770ad26512fc8e826a8d93f1.png] **__Shortcut Trick__**8.99 + 17.99 - 3.99 × 2.99 = ?\n\nClosest approximate value :- \n\n8.99 = 9, 17.99 = 18, 3.99 = 4, 2.99 = 3.\n\n⇒ 9 + 18 - 4 × 3 = ?\n\n⇒ 27 - 12 = 15.",
